op","x":1696,"y":1591,"width":49,"height":26}]},{"text":"이라 불리는 변수가 1개만 존재하는데 비해 큐에서는 두개의 변수가 시용된다. 삽입과 관련된 변","words":[{"text":"이라","x":388,"y":1644,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"불리는","x":457,"y":1643,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"변수가","x":560,"y":1642,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"1개만","x":659,"y":1642,"width":73,"height":33},{"text":"존재하는데","x":742,"y":1641,"width":150,"height":34},{"text":"비해","x":908,"y":1641,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"큐에서는","x":980,"y":1641,"width":126,"height":33},{"text":"두개의","x":1117,"y":1642,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"변수가","x":1225,"y":1641,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1332,"y":1640,"width":140,"height":34},{"text":"삽입과","x":1489,"y":1640,"width":103,"height":33},{"text":"관련된","x":1603,"y":1640,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"변","x":1717,"y":1640,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"수를 rear라고 하고 삭제와 관련된 변수를 front라고 한다.","words":[{"text":"수를","x":387,"y":1702,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"rear라고","x":460,"y":1700,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"하고","x":592,"y":1700,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"삭제와","x":661,"y":1699,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"관련된","x":762,"y":1699,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"변수를","x":867,"y":1698,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"front라고","x":970,"y":1699,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":1127,"y":1699,"width":71,"height":34}]},{"text":"큐도 스택과 마찬가지로 “프로그래머의 도구로서 폭넓게 이용된다. 많이 이용되는 분야는 컴","words":[{"text":"큐도","x":422,"y":1760,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"스택과","x":493,"y":1758,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":593,"y":1757,"width":150,"height":34},{"text":"“프로그래머의","x":754,"y":1756,"width":194,"height":34},{"text":"도구로서","x":963,"y":1756,"width":134,"height":34},{"text":"폭넓게","x":1112,"y":1756,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"이용된다.","x":1222,"y":1755,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"많이","x":1374,"y":1754,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"이용되는","x":1455,"y":1754,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"분야는","x":1601,"y":1754,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":